WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.000
-Welcome back.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.567
We are hanging out
with Matthew McConaughey, y'all!

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.400
-Hey.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.601
-Matthew, I was reading
the book earlier,

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:14.167
and I just got to say I love it
and I really do recommend it,

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:16.734
but I love that
it has a rhythm to it, a good --

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:18.133
Like, it's like...

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:19.734
"Just because
they threw the dart

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:21.667
doesn't mean that it's stuck.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:26.033
Just because I've got skills
doesn't mean there is no luck."

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.267
-♪ Bum, bum, bum ♪
-Yeah. You see what I'm saying?

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.968
So what I was thinking
would be kind of fun

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:32.634
is if we added maybe, like,
a little music to it.

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:34.367
-Oh, I like that.
-Like --

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.000
Like, you can get a little..
-A little...

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.934
A little something tasty.
Syrup underneath.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:39.367
-You guys wanna get tasty
with this?

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:42.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.834
-Kirk. Kirk.
You got a little guitar?

00:00:44.834 --> 00:00:46.634
Like, a little something
tasty for...

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:50.267
[ Guitar riffing ]

00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:52.067
♪ Just because
they threw the dart ♪

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.200
♪ Doesn't mean that it's stuck ♪
-No.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.334
♪ And just because
I've got skills ♪

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.434
♪ Don't mean there is no luck ♪

00:00:58.434 --> 00:01:00.267
-♪ Just because
they let you down ♪

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.968
♪ Doesn't mean
you gotta get low ♪

00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:04.467
-♪ No, and just because
they're clumsy ♪

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:06.834
♪ Don't mean they got no flow ♪

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:10.300
-♪ Just because I'm finished
doesn't mean that I'm done ♪

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.901
-♪ No, and just because
you got the gold ♪

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:14.567
♪ Don't mean that you have won ♪

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:15.734
-Take this.
-♪ Hey ♪

00:01:15.734 --> 00:01:17.100
♪ Just because
you can pull it off ♪

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.968
♪ Doesn't mean
that you should do it ♪

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:21.033
-♪ And just because you failed ♪

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:23.400
♪ That don't mean
that you blew it ♪

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.267
-♪ Just because
you threw shade ♪

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:27.300
♪ Doesn't mean
I'm out of the sun ♪

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.334
-♪ And just because
you shut me down ♪

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:31.467
♪ Doesn't mean I have not won ♪

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:35.400
-♪ Just because they can choose
doesn't mean you have a choice ♪

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.334
-♪ And just because
they don't hear you ♪

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:39.634
♪ Doesn't mean
you have no voice ♪

00:01:39.634 --> 00:01:43.234
-♪ Just because I'm dirty
doesn't mean I can't get clean ♪

00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:45.133
-♪ Well, just because
you're nice ♪

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:47.567
♪ Don't mean I can't get mean ♪

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:49.567
-♪ Just because
I'm going in circles ♪

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.534
♪ Doesn't mean that I'm dizzy ♪

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:53.634
-♪ And just because
I'm sitting still ♪

00:01:53.634 --> 00:01:55.801
♪ Doesn't mean
that I'm not busy ♪

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:57.634
-♪ Just because you and I
are friends ♪

00:01:57.634 --> 00:01:59.634
♪ Doesn't mean
that you can't burn me ♪

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:01.567
-♪ And just because
I'm stubborn ♪

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:03.734
♪ Well, that don't mean
that you can't turn me ♪

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:05.901
-♪ Now, just because
I forgive you ♪

00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:07.434
♪ Doesn't mean
that I still trust ♪

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:09.968
-♪ You see, there's what you do,
there's what I do ♪

00:02:09.968 --> 00:02:12.100
♪ And yours is not my must ♪

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:16.033
-♪ Just because it's fiction,
it don't mean it can't be true ♪

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:18.033
-♪ And just because
you want one more ♪

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:20.167
♪ Don't mean that you need two ♪

00:02:20.167 --> 00:02:24.000
-♪ Just because we disagree
doesn't mean you're not right ♪

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.000
♪ And just because it's dark
doesn't mean that it's night ♪

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.033
-♪ Just because
the sun has set ♪

00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:32.234
♪ Doesn't mean
it will not rise ♪

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:33.801
-Why is that?
Why is that? Why is that?

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:36.968
-Why? Why? Why?!
-Why?

00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:40.434
-Because every day
is a new gift,

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:43.334
each one a new surprise.

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:44.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.968 --> 00:02:47.067
-Matthew McConaughey, everybody!
-Hey, hey, hey.

00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:51.534
-"Just Because" is available
wherever books are sold.

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:55.133
You're the best, buddy.
We'll be right back, everybody!

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:57.100
-Whoo!

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:01.868
♪♪

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:05.400
-♪ Oda-lay-hay, hey, hey, hey ♪

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:09.801
♪ Oda-lay-hay,
hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

